Gummi Diagnostics – Privacy Policy
Last updated: 21 October 2026

What we collect. When you message Gummi Diagnostics on WhatsApp, we receive your WhatsApp phone number, profile name and the messages you send us.

How we use it. Only to reply to your questions about our clinic and diagnostic services, such as tests, timings, prices and bookings. We use automated software, including AI, to generate replies.

Sharing. We do not sell your data. Messages are processed through Meta’s WhatsApp Business Platform and our own service providers only to deliver replies.

Retention. We keep conversation data only as long as needed to answer you, and no longer than 90 days, unless the law requires otherwise.

Data deletion. To delete your data, send “DELETE MY DATA” to our WhatsApp number or email your-email@example.com. We delete your records within 30 days and confirm by reply.

Contact. your-email@example.com
